  "description": "Ethan, a promising researcher at the pharmaceutical company Newrix, is kidnapped by mysterious gangsters on his way home from work.\nDragged away without understanding why, he is given only one demand by the gang boss, Ramon: manufacture the powerful drug he had been researching, Exidrin.\n\nReduced in an instant to the gang’s drug maker, Ethan waits for a chance and attempts to escape—but ends up cornered at gunpoint.\nJust as the trigger is about to be pulled, a strange man appears from nowhere and saves him.\n\n“You the one who made Exidrin?”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/TrustFall)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish (Sep 16)",
